    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies that iterating forward with {@link LoopingListIterator#next()} and calling {@link LoopingListIterator#remove()} after each element drains the wrapped list one element at a time, in order. <p>The list starts as [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]. Each iteration removes the element that was just returned, shrinking the backing list until it is empty. Once empty, the iterator reports no further elements and {@code next()} throws.</p>"
   },
